            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>I: n Languedoc-Roussillon, the Domoplaies telemedicine project provides support to nurses experiencing difficulties with the treatment of a wound at home or in a health institute. Thanks to new communication and information technologies, doctors and nurses with expertise in wounds and wound healing can offer individualised care management.</AbstractText>
